OL,3,GNEWSADaughter of man, 82, killed in
OL,4,Arandom attack calls for tighter mental
OL,5,Ahealth restrictions
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'd like it to never happen to another
OL,8,Ffamily again, but that's idealistic. I
OL,9,Fthink things need to change, huge
OL,10,Fchanges need to be made."
OL,12,FGerard Ring, 82, died three days after
OL,13,Fhe was stabbed in his front garden by
OL,14,FJulian Donoher, a man with a history of
OL,15,Fmental health problems including
OL,16,Fschizoaffective disorder.
